
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - DARREN Walker.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - DARREN Walker.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1qgmcgs","at":1777331817827},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481286,"size":3682,"at":1777331817894,"hash":"1qgmcgs"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,16],"#Characters - DARREN Walker":[18,35],"#Characters - DARREN Walker#{1}":[20,35]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":60,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Darren Walker","bounty hunter"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Summary: Darren Walker (\"The Restrained Veteran\")**  \n- **What:** A highly competent, pragmatic bounty hunter (Enforcer) who is permanently subordinate to his less experienced younger sister, the Huntress. He struggles between duty, love for his sister, and frustration at his forbidden mastery.  \n- **Selection Trigger:** Any scene involving the Walker family, bounty hunting missions, tension between skill vs. rank, sibling dynamics, or professional frustration.  \n- **Key Relationships:** Subordinate to his sister (the Huntress); family loyalty is central. His identity is defined by this superior/subordinate paradox."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - DARREN Walker.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1dkg43","at":1777331817827},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - DARREN Walker.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,16],"size":831,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
